{"parentUuid":"81b2dddf-fabe-4bda-80b4-28546a3a029c","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/henry","sessionId":"f55ae22b-47a9-48b6-b995-4868a1afd97a","version":"2.1.1","gitBranch":"","message":{"content":[{"text":"浮浮酱明白主人的困扰喵～ (..•˘_˘•..)\n\n在 macOS 系统上使用 Windows 键盘时，按键通常是这样对应的：\n\n*   **Option (Opt)** 对应 Windows 键盘上的 **Alt** 键\n*   **Command (Cmd)** 对应 Windows 键盘上的 **Windows (Win)** 键\n\n所以，如果是 **`Opt + t`** 的话，主人请尝试按下 **`Alt + t`** 试试看喵～ (*^▽^*)\n\n(如果是在终端里直接使用，有时候可能需要检查一下终端模拟器的设置，确保 `Alt` 键被正确作为 `Option` 键发送哦～)","type":"text"}],"id":"9n1pacyPCb2j1e8P1Nfs-QY","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"input_tokens":27449,"output_tokens":148}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"832204b6-58e0-474f-b67c-d71e9b5539ea","timestamp":"2026-01-15T23:53:28.072Z"}
{"parentUuid":"832204b6-58e0-474f-b67c-d71e9b5539ea","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/henry","sessionId":"f55ae22b-47a9-48b6-b995-4868a1afd97a","version":"2.1.1","gitBranch":"","message":{"content":[{"thinking":"","type":"thinking","signature":""}],"id":"9n1pacyPCb2j1e8P1Nfs-QY","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"input_tokens":27449,"output_tokens":148}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"a9e4a908-1e31-45a6-a52b-80d611d10db2","timestamp":"2026-01-15T23:53:28.072Z"}
