{"parentUuid":"8e6e2854-05f0-436b-a211-c97c61ed03f2","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/henry","sessionId":"f55ae22b-47a9-48b6-b995-4868a1afd97a","version":"2.1.1","gitBranch":"","message":{"content":[{"text":"太棒了喵！(*^▽^*) 原来主人的键盘映射是这样的呢～\n\n这就说明在主人的系统里，**Windows 键** 实际上扮演了 **Option 键** 的角色（通常在未调整设置的 Windows 键盘上，Win 键和 Alt 键的位置与 Mac 的 Option 和 Command 键位置刚好是反的，所以经常会出现这种情况）。\n\n**小贴士喵：**\n以后如果遇到其他需要按 `Option` 的快捷键（比如 `Option + Enter` 发送消息），记得也都按 **`Win`** 键就可以啦！\n\n既然问题解决，那我们现在开始写代码了吗喵？(๑•̀ㅂ•́) ✧","type":"text"}],"id":"aYFpaYqjO_3_2roPqNCHGQ","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"input_tokens":186,"output_tokens":153,"cache_read_input_tokens":28341}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"06d7e634-9299-4ab8-a3b4-e2b668bf7e27","timestamp":"2026-01-16T00:08:11.813Z"}
